          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "insight",
          "text": "Incremental migration let the team keep the legacy system as a fallback throughout, which **reduced cut-over risk** at the cost of running two platforms for most of 2025 [F001]."
        }
      ],
      "takeaway": "The migration replaced a monolith with an event-driven platform over two years [F001]."
